src/adacovex	Version constant
src/adacovex_version_info	Generated version constant (from alire-dev.toml / ADACOVEX_VERSION)
src/adacovex_main	CLI entry point (builds as bin/adacovex; covex alias)
src/compliance/adacovex-compliance	Parent package for DO-178C compliance assessment
src/compliance/adacovex-compliance-dal	DAL level assessment logic (DAL-A..E criteria)
src/core/adacovex-core	Parent package for core data types and configuration
src/core/adacovex-types	All domain types + conversion functions
src/core/adacovex-vcs	VCS abstraction (git/hg/svn/fossil/jj detection + base snapshots)
src/core/adacovex-config	CLI argument parser (prove mode, --no-sbom, --sbom-format)
src/core/adacovex-diff	Differential assessment (--compare-base / --coverage-delta)
src/core/adacovex-prove	GNATprove runner for the `prove` subcommand (alire-first toolchain resolution)
src/core/adacovex-cache	On-disk result cache (content-hashed per-file, oldest-first eviction, size policy)
src/core/adacovex-cpus	Host CPU/CI detection + GNATprove parallelism resolution
src/ir/adacovex-target_profiles	Bounded IR scalar types (IR_Int8..IR_Int64 / IR_UInt8..IR_UInt64) + host/target config
src/ir/adacovex-ir_bounds	Bounds-verification fixture (synthesized lowered types, gnatprove-proved)
src/ir/adacovex-ir_synthesiser	Future-use IR synthesiser (foreign type-name lowering to bounded Ada)
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers	Parent package for all input-file parsers
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-source	Ada source scanner (procs/funcs/docstrings/HLR)
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-gnatprove	GNATprove .out parser
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-tests	AUnit test-result parser
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-do178c	HLR/LLR markdown parser + source tag matcher
src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-manifest	Alire manifest / alire.lock / .gpr dep graph
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers	Parent package for all output renderers
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-ansi	Terminal ANSI report (NO_COLOR aware)
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-markdown	VERIFICATION.md + TRACE.md
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-svg	SVG badges (spark/tests/do178c/docs)
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-html	Web dashboard + JSON API
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-man	Man-page renderer + installer (local man db, Linux/WSL)
src/renderers/adacovex-renderers-sbom	CycloneDX 1.5 / SPDX 2.3 / Markdown SBOM generator
src/server/adacovex-server	Parent package for the HTTP server subsystem
src/server/adacovex-server-http	HTTP/1.1 server (4-worker task pool)
src/server/adacovex-server-router	Parent package for HTTP request routing (future expansion)
src/tests/adacovex-test_support	Native test Runner type
